SUMMARY:Americans We: The Eagles Community Band at 90
LOCATION:Colonial Theatre\, 111 South St\, Pittsfield\, MA 01201
DESCRIPTION:The Eagles Band comes to the Colonial to present Americans We\,
  a celebratory concert of two anniversaries. The first half of the program
  is the finale to the Semiquincentennial year they have all been observing
 . It includes music rooted in our country’s history\, with works by John
  Williams\, Lin-Manuel Miranda\, a salute to American jazz\, and "Tribute 
 to America" by director David Diggs.\nhttps://www.berkshiretheatregroup.or
 g/calendar/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.berkshiretheatregroup.org/calendar/
END:VEVENT
