SUMMARY:Wandering Dance Festival
LOCATION:Colonial Theatre\, 111 South St\, Pittsfield\, MA 01201
DESCRIPTION:Discover the joy of movement as the Wandering Dance Festival re
 turns to downtown Pittsfield for its fourth year. Developed and sponsored 
 by Mill Town Foundation\, the festival brings people of all ages and backg
 rounds together through workshops and community events from November 6–1
 3.\nhttps://www.berkshiretheatregroup.org/event/wandering-dance-festival/\
 nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
