SUMMARY:A Colonial Candlelight Concert
LOCATION:Colonial Theatre\, 111 South St\, Pittsfield\, MA 01201
DESCRIPTION:The Light Before Christmas with Trek Track Collective\nBased in
  the Berkshires\, Trek Track Collective is a premier string quartet featur
 ing violinists Eileen Markland and Hannah Roberts\, violist Bing Liu\, and
  cellist Robbie Wilson. Each musician brings a distinguished career spanni
 ng classical\, jazz and folk traditions\, creating a rich and expressive s
 ound that is both elegant and deeply moving.\nhttps://www.berkshiretheatre
 group.org/calendar/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/weste
 rnma/
